WEBVTT

00:09:28.731 --> 00:09:31.150
(Drill whirrs)

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:42.661
So in 2008, I founded a nonprofit

00:09:42.703 --> 00:09:46.582
to teach design and construction skills
to middle and high school students,

00:09:46.624 --> 00:09:48.542
specifically young women of color.

00:09:49.543 --> 00:09:51.795
Now, nearly 14 years later,

00:09:51.837 --> 00:09:54.715
that nonprofit, Girls Garage,

00:09:54.757 --> 00:09:58.385
has taught over 1,000 girls
and gender-expansive youth

00:09:58.427 --> 00:09:59.928
how to use power tools --

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:05.142
(Applause)